  m_text: "How to Play:\n\nFor Regular Mode:\nYour goal is collect 4 pumpkins hidden
    throughout the maze. \nGhosts in the maze will try to chase you. \nThey will
    only move when you don't look at them. \nYou get 3 lives to start. Pickup chocolate
    to gain more lives.\n\nFor Endless Mode: \nSame rules as regular mode but get
    as many pumpkins as possible without getting caught by the ghosts. Beware...
    the more you collect...the more ghosts will come to get you!\n\n"
